<title>ETHIOPIA: SOCCER-ETHIOPIA BEAT UGANDA ON PENALTIES IN AFRICAN NATIONS CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ETHIOPIA BEAT UGANDA ON PENALTIES IN AFRICAN NATIONS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>ADDIS ABABA 1996-08-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ethiopia and Uganda drew 1-1</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in their African Nations Cup preliminary round,</p>
<p>second leg match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Attendance: 25,000</p>
<p>Aggregate 2-2. Ethiopia won 4-2 penalties.</p>
</text>
